# Flexport

> Flexport is a freight forwarder, customs broker, and fulfillment provider running AI-powered ocean, air, and trucking logistics with real-time visibility.

Flexport is a freight forwarder, customs broker, and fulfillment provider. It moves goods worldwide by ocean, air, and ground, clears customs, and runs fulfillment—giving businesses one place to see and control their supply chain from the factory floor to the customer's door.

This file indexes Flexport's site for language models: its products and solutions, and its editorial libraries—blog, case studies, glossary, help center, e-guides, webinars, global logistics updates, videos, and FlexU courses. Each link resolves to the full page in Markdown.

